  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $295.22B (+1.3% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/illinois-crypto-tax-rules-defi-stablecoins?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Illinois draft crypto tax rules detail DeFi, stablecoin treatment</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPWUFCOEU1Mnl4cHp4M0ItU29DekdiZjE5SkRLeWtnUkVRNVBVRUhoQm95YXVvbHpJUV9fVW5NTWRsQ2U3eF8taDI0ZmE1TWtmR2UyejBkSHBHZXdjWjU1RE9fZWp2NHhQNngxU2k2aTR2Mk5UTWFJZGFGUmpERGdta2pteUhXU3EtbHVURzdvdVBrVUVNTkdwQ3lCTG1ocFdKaVFJZmIyM2NiczZVM3o0aVkzM0JxZV9vbTY2UUZJcw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Binance&#x27;s $100M Circle (CRCL) deal boosts USDC in stablecoin race with Tether, analysts say</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-09-28-citi-coinbase-stablecoin-payments-corporate-clients-417082\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Citi expands Coinbase partnership to power stablecoin payments for businesses</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
